      47.99,
      528.98,
      542.49,
      552.45
    ],
    "text": "1. These regulations may be cited as the Regulations for Satellite Broadband Service and shall come into effect from Tuesday, August 13, 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.99,
      558.98,
      542.46,
      582.45
    ],
    "text": "2. Licence fees for the use of radio frequency or radio frequency emitting apparatus by a Satellite Broadband Service including user terminals are as setout in the Schedule hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.99,
      588.98,
      542.5,
      612.45
    ],
    "text": "3. In these Regulations, unless the context otherwise requires - \u201cLicence\u201d shall mean a licence issued under Section 22 of the Act.",
